Bulkhead Melisma
Ingredients: MINIMAL TECHNO + K-R&B + 432Hz RELAXING MEDITATIVE STYLES + BRUT (HARDSTYLE INDUSTRIAL TECHNO)
Creative Catalyst: Its first record was cut aboard a generation ship halfway to Proxima Centauri.

Bulkhead Melisma sounds like an intimate, honeyed bedroom R&B recording session violently staged inside the screaming engine room of an interstellar transport ark. Relentless, overdriven hardstyle industrial kicks and microscopic, dry minimal techno clicks smash through the soundscape like pressurized airlocks, only to be suspended in mid-air by soothing 432Hz frosted crystal bowl hums and weightless, autotuned Korean-vocal runs dripping with bruised romance.

