  3. Micro-Syllabic Auto-Chop: Hyper-intimate, breath-heavy Korean vocal runs diced into millisecond-length rhythmic micro-stutters that lock into the minimal techno hi-hat grid.
- Dynamics: Violent bipolar swings: yawning expanses of deafening silence and meditative quartz chimes abruptly crushed by 145 BPM walls of distorted square-wave kicks, instantly collapsing into a single, unadorned falsetto sigh.

